  "script": "Superman just got arrested? Deputies in Hillsborough County, Florida got a call about a boat burglary in Ruskin \u2014 someone broke into the cabin, walked off with a bag of power tools. Body camera rolls up. And there he is: cape, full costume, the whole look. His name's James Tidwell, 57, a convicted felon who apparently thought the disguise would help. It did not. Tidwell confessed on camera before deputies even finished reading him his rights. He's now charged with burglary of an unoccupied conveyance and petit theft \u2014 dressed like the Man of Steel, booked like everybody else. Even superheroes get read their rights in Ruskin. So did the cape make it better, or just easier to spot?",
